  "title": "Michael&#39;s Easy Lentil Loaf",
  "description": "Cooked lentils, quick oats, and Cheddar cheese mixed with tomato sauce, onion, and spices create a yummy, budget-friendly vegetarian lentil loaf.",
  "authors": [
